<title>JAPAN: Fuji Denki Reiki - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fuji Denki Reiki - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 79.04		vs	   80.35</p>
<p> Operating	    1.91		vs	    2.06</p>
<p> Current		1.94		vs	    2.15</p>
<p> Net		  748    million    vs	  873    million</p>
<p> EPS		   14.96 yen	  vs	   18.32 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     50 million	  vs	  48 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fuji Denki Reiki Co Ltd is a seller of vending machines and cold chain equipment.</p>
